# Database Template

Purpose:
  Template for module database specifications.

Database: <MODULE_NAME>

Tables:
  - <table_name>

Schema:
  <table_name>:
    columns:
      - <column_name>: <type>

Relationships:
  - <table_name> belongs_to <other_table>

Migrations:
  - <migration_file>

Rules:
  [D1] Database changes MUST be validated before BE implementation.
  [D2] Migration files MUST be versioned.
  [D3] Schema changes MUST be backward compatible when possible.


State: +

